{"type": "response.output_text.done", "item_id": "msg_0009", "output_index": 5, "content_index": 0, "text": "Right now in S\u00e3o Paulo, it is **14:50 on Wednesday, 16 September 2026**.\n\nThe repository knowledge base says its **harnesses** are ways of running the agent loop:\n\n- The **prompt-agent harness** lets **Foundry run the loop**.\n- The **langgraph harness** would run the loop **in the project\u2019s own container**, hosted by Foundry.\n- Both sit behind the same **`HarnessAdapter` contract**.\n- Both emit the same **`AgentEvent` stream**, so the frontend, traces, and voice functionality work with either harness.", "logprobs": [], "sequence_number": 158}
